  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0\n      - Added a fluent builder for PdfRequest, mirroring the CobaltEngine fluent API: PdfRequest.ForUrl(url) / PdfRequest.ForHtml(html), chained .WithPaperFormat/.WithMargins/.WithHeader/.WithWatermark/.WithEncryption/.WithMetadata/.AddCookie/... then .Build(). PdfRequest.ToBuilder() adapts an existing instance.\n      - Purely additive: PdfRequest is unchanged and object-initializer construction works exactly as before. The fluent path produces an identical PdfRequest (and identical JSON).",
